sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Backend API
  participant M as Metrics Registry
  participant Q as BullMQ Worker
  participant P as External Provider
  participant S as Sentry
  participant PM as Prometheus
  participant G as Grafana

  C->>API: HTTP request
  API->>M: Increment active request
  API-->>C: HTTP response
  API->>M: Record normalized route/status/duration

  Q->>M: Record job start and queue wait
  Q->>P: Provider operation
  P-->>Q: Result or error
  Q->>M: Record provider and job outcome

  alt Unexpected terminal/infrastructure failure
    Q->>S: Sanitized background exception
  else Retry or expected business outcome
    Q->>M: Counter only
  end

  PM->>API: Scrape GET /metrics every 30s
  API-->>PM: Prometheus text format
  G->>PM: Query metrics
  PM-->>G: Time-series data

